  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "난 트리앙이라고 해.\n인디 게임을 개발하고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B09C0020D2B8B9ACC559C774B77CACE00020D574002E000AC778B5140020AC8CC784C7440020AC1CBC1CD558ACE00020C788C5B4002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특히, 폴리곤에 대한 거라면\n빠삭하게 알고 있지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9D788002C0020D3F4B9ACACE4C5D00020B300D55C0020AC70B77CBA74000ABE60C0ADD558AC8C0020C54CACE00020C788C9C0002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폴리곤이 뭔지는 아니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3F4B9ACACE4C7740020BB54C9C0B2940020C544B2C8003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC774C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3D랑 관련된 거요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00330044B7910020AD00B828B41C0020AC70C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 의미론 정답이라고 할 수 있겠네.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020C758BBF8B8600020C815B2F5C774B77CACE00020D5600020C2180020C788ACA0B124002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞아! 3D 컴퓨터 그래픽스에 사용되는\n폴리곤을 말하는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC54400210020003300440020CEF4D4E8D1300020ADF8B798D53DC2A4C5D00020C0ACC6A9B418B294000AD3F4B9ACACE4C7440020B9D0D558B2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 플레이하는 게임 속의\n입체적인 캐릭터, 다시 말해 모델은<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020D50CB808C774D558B2940020AC8CC7840020C18DC758000AC785CCB4C801C7780020CE90B9ADD130002C0020B2E4C2DC0020B9D0D5740020BAA8B378C74000100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폴리곤 모델링이라는 방식으로\n만들어져 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3F4B9ACACE40020BAA8B378B9C1C774B77CB2940020BC29C2DDC73CB85C000AB9CCB4E4C5B4C8380020C788C5B4002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폴리곤 모델링이라는 건\n3차원 공간 위에 다각형을 조합해서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어떤 형태를 만드는 걸 말하는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3F4B9ACACE40020BAA8B378B9C1C774B77CB2940020AC74000A0033CC28C6D00020ACF5AC040020C704C5D00020B2E4AC01D615C7440020C870D569D574C11C00100001BE00000AC5B4B5A40020D615D0DCB97C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC780020B9D0D558B2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폴리곤을 많이 사용할수록\n둥글고 매끈한 질감을 표현할 수 있지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3F4B9ACACE4C7440020B9CEC7740020C0ACC6A9D560C218B85D000AB465AE00ACE00020B9E4B048D55C0020C9C8AC10C7440020D45CD604D5600020C2180020C788C9C0002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 옛날에는 많이 사용하면\n처리에 부하가 심해져서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n각진 모습이 많았지만 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C61BB0A0C5D0B2940020B9CEC7740020C0ACC6A9D558BA74000ACC98B9ACC5D00020BD80D558AC000020C2ECD574C838C11C00100001BE00000AAC01C9C40020BAA8C2B5C7740020B9CEC558C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 폴리곤도 당시 기준으로\n최첨단 기술에 의해 만들어졌다고 하는데,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n기술은 진보하기 마련 아니겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020D3F4B9ACACE4B3C40020B2F9C2DC0020AE30C900C73CB85C000ACD5CCCA8B2E80020AE30C220C5D00020C758D5740020B9CCB4E4C5B4C84CB2E4ACE00020D558B294B370002C00100001BE00000AAE30C220C7400020C9C4BCF4D558AE300020B9C8B8280020C544B2C8ACA0C5B4003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 본론을 말할게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020BCF8B860C7440020B9D0D560AC8C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나의 폴리곤과\n너의 폴리곤을 교환해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C7580020D3F4B9ACACE4ACFC000AB108C7580020D3F4B9ACACE4C7440020AD50D658D5740020C918002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나의 폴리곤과\n너의 폴리곤을 교환해 줄 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C7580020D3F4B9ACACE4ACFC000AB108C7580020D3F4B9ACACE4C7440020AD50D658D5740020C9040020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "교환해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD50D658D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폴리곤과 폴리곤의 교환이라니,\n너무나도 두근거리는걸!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3F4B9ACACE4ACFC0020D3F4B9ACACE4C7580020AD50D658C774B77CB2C8002C000AB108BB34B098B3C40020B450ADFCAC70B9ACB294AC78002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아!\n서로의 폴리곤을 교환하자!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC5440021000AC11CB85CC7580020D3F4B9ACACE4C7440020AD50D658D558C790002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나의 폴리곤과\n너의 폴리곤을 교환해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C7580020D3F4B9ACACE4ACFC000AB108C7580020D3F4B9ACACE4C7440020AD50D658D5740020C918002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 교환해 줬으면 하는 건\n폴리곤이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020AD50D658D5740020C92CC73CBA740020D558B2940020AC74000AD3F4B9ACACE4C774C57C002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...오잉!?\n매끈이의 모습이...!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC624C7890021003F000AB9E4B048C774C7580020BAA8C2B5C774002E002E002E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "놀랐지? 내가 주는 깜짝선물이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B180B790C9C0003F0020B0B4AC000020C8FCB2940020AE5CC9DDC120BB3CC774C57C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너에게 준 폴리곤에게\n업그레이드를 지니게 했거든.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C5D0AC8C0020C9000020D3F4B9ACACE4C5D0AC8C000AC5C5ADF8B808C774B4DCB97C0020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D588AC70B4E0002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 이렇게\n폴리곤2로 진화한 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C774B807AC8C000AD3F4B9ACACE40032B85C0020C9C4D654D55C0020AC70C57C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어때? 둥글고 매끈해진 몸만 봐도\n처리 성능이 향상됐다는 걸 바로 알겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B54C003F0020B465AE00ACE00020B9E4B048D574C9C40020BAB8B9CC0020BD10B3C4000ACC98B9AC0020C131B2A5C7740020D5A5C0C1B410B2E4B2940020AC780020BC14B85C0020C54CACA0C9C0003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "버전이 올라가면서 인공 지능이 탑재되고\n행성 개발용 프로그램이 설치되긴 했지만,<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC84C804C7740020C62CB77CAC00BA74C11C0020C778ACF50020C9C0B2A5C7740020D0D1C7ACB418ACE0000AD589C1310020AC1CBC1CC6A90020D504B85CADF8B7A8C7740020C124CE58B418AE340020D588C9C0B9CC002C00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여전히 손이 많이 가는 포켓몬이라는 점이 또\n사랑스러운 부분이란 말이지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECC804D7880020C190C7740020B9CEC7740020AC00B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB2940020C810C7740020B610000AC0ACB791C2A4B7ECC6B40020BD80BD84C774B7800020B9D0C774C9C0002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음?\n이 빛은 설마...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74C003F000AC7740020BE5BC7400020C124B9C8002E002E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 폴리곤에게\n업그레이드를 지니게 했구나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B3C40020D3F4B9ACACE4C5D0AC8C000AC5C5ADF8B808C774B4DCB97C0020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D588AD6CB098002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네 쪽에서도 깜짝선물이 있었을 줄이야!\n고마워! 정말로 멋진 포켓몬 교환이었어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1240020CABDC5D0C11CB3C40020AE5CC9DDC120BB3CC7740020C788C5C8C7440020C904C774C57C0021000AACE0B9C8C6CC00210020C815B9D0B85C0020BA4BC9C40020D3ECCF13BAAC0020AD50D658C774C5C8C5B4002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폴리곤2의\n추가 업데이트도 있으려나?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3F4B9ACACE40032C758000ACD94AC000020C5C5B370C774D2B8B3C40020C788C73CB824B098003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포리리?",
